WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Local development gets messy fast. Projects compete for Postgres, Redis, and the same ports.

00:06.000 --> 00:10.500
Understanding what is happening means bouncing between terminals.

00:10.500 --> 00:16.500
Portless turns your environment into one control plane. Run Portless up.

00:16.500 --> 00:21.500
It starts processes and containers, then gives every application a clean localhost address.

00:21.500 --> 00:29.500
Watch traffic flow from checkout to orders, Postgres, and Redis. Open a request to inspect status, timing, headers, and response.

00:29.500 --> 00:38.000
Record a workflow, or introduce latency, errors, and aborted connections on one edge.

00:38.000 --> 00:46.500
One project. Multiple environments. Run it, see it, and break it—locally.
